<title>USA: KLLM Transport executives to buy shares.</title>
<headline>KLLM Transport executives to buy shares.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Miss. 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>KLLM Transport Services Inc said on Monday that 10 of its officers have agreed to buy about 200,000 shares of common stock from the company.</p>
<p>These individuals have agreed to buy the shares over the next five years, KLLM said.</p>
<p>The prices of the shares that the executives will buy will increase to give the executives an incentive to boost the value of the company's stock, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>KLLM has approximately 4.4 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
